P.append(page('Vector style, animation method and loop structure','',
 '<div class="cols"><div><h2 style="font-size:14px">Art direction</h2><ul class="lang" style="padding-left:16px"><li>Flat vector, thick rounded outlines in navy, two-tone fills from the Devdha palette (navy, blue, light blue, cream, gold) plus coral and green accents.</li><li>Faceless characters (dot-free faces, simple hair shapes) so they work in any culture and are quick to animate.</li><li>Every vignette 3.8 s: 1 s in, 2 s action, 0.8 s arrow; the product text types under it in EN/HI/MR.</li><li>All animation is built in SVG and driven by time, so it renders frame-by-frame like the earlier videos (looped steam, swinging tags, scrolling straps, layered 3D print).</li><li>Edge arrows and the gold edge bar are part of the frame so they line up with the physical shelf.</li></ul><h2 style="font-size:14px;margin-top:6px">Rate-free</h2><p class="lang">No price on any vignette. Text only says what it is and invites people in.</p></div><div>'+tbl(['Time','Block'],[['0–9','HOOK: look up / right / down, it\'s all real, come inside'],['9–19','Websites (vector browser)'],['19–27','Software (vector dashboard)'],['27–37','Design (your real designs swipe)'],['37–47','Video editing (timeline + your clips)'],['47–55','Printing (vector press + your designs)'],['55–70','TOP zone: 4 vignettes (15 s)'],['70–82','RIGHT zone: 3 vignettes (12 s)'],['82–98','BOTTOM zone: 4 vignettes (16 s)'],['98–104','How it works'],['104–116','Our Work wall (designs + clips)'],['116–124','Visit us + QR + "come inside"'],['124–127','Loop-back']])+'<div class="warn">≈ 127 s per language, 6 min 21 s for three. Shorter cut: drop Software and How it works → 113 s.</div></div></div>'))
